creen. Explore a few directions or fix specific problems, and see the evidence behind each change. You get a before and after image and a short report. The redesign stays in your own design system, and anything that already works is kept. Use whenever the user points at a screen, section, or component they have, or at a reference, a Mobbin result, one or more Mobbin collections or the screens they saved, and asks to redesign, improve, restyle, or rebuild it, or to see a few directions for it.", "declared_name": "redesign-screen", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
